>> >>>     Also, I find it hard to believe that sequence errors would be
>> >>> causing
>> >>> you trouble at 10%, as long as you're filtering for quality and have
>> >>> decent
>> >>> coverage. PCR might in limited cases, and Picard effectively takes
>> >>> care of
>> >>> that.****
>> >>>
