>> >>> defaults in tallyVariants() use 1% as a cutoff if I?m not
>> >>> mistaken.****
>> >>>
>> >>>  ****
>> >>>
>> >>>  ** **
>> >>>
>> >>> It uses a ~4% cutoff. And yes, you'll start running into issues around
>> >>> 1%.
