From julian.gehring at embl.de  Tue Aug  6 22:19:24 2013
From: julian.gehring at embl.de (Julian Gehring)
Date: Tue, 6 Aug 2013 22:19:24 +0200
Subject: [BioC] ggbio: Data stored twice in 'GGbio' object
In-Reply-To: <CAOQ5NycMovHtU5Yy2p+GT8tDc6WVp377Gjdn0p4ATLt1GBFpow@mail.gmail.com>
References: <5200C306.30608@embl.de>
