What would be the correct formula in limma to analysis this experiment?
right now i'm just doing
design <- modelMatrix(targets,ref="Ctr")
fit <- lmFit(MAprobes.n,design)
cont.matrix<-makeContrasts(Cy_1=Cy1,
                           Cy_2=Cy2,
                           Cy_3=Cy3,
                           Cy_4=Cy4,
                           Cy_5=Cy5,
                           Cy_6=Cy6,levels=design)
c.fit<-contrasts.fit(fit, contrasts=cont.matrix)

but this does not take the technical replication into account nor the fact that the biological replicates are not on the "same level" (same experiment vs replicated experiment). I know the use of blocking factor and how to estimate correlation, but I really don't know how to integrate these three levels all together.

